| 2025 impairment concentration | Direct IM impairments: **$37.210m total / $8.853m Acadia share**; Bald Hill JV: **$3.5m total / $0.7m Acadia share** | Risk-management weakness: impairments were clustered in mid/late 2025 and attributed to reduced/shortened holding periods [2][3]. |
