About Edelweiss Financial Services Ltd.Updated on Dec 2, 2025
Incorporated in November 1995, Edelweiss Financial Services Limited (EFSL), formerly known as Edelweiss Capital Limited, is a Mumbai-based investment banking firm and Merchant Banker.
Edelweiss provides retail and corporate credit, asset management, including mutual fund and alternative asset management, asset reconstruction, insurance both life and general insurance, and wealth management services through its subsidiaries. Edelweiss Group comprises 27 subsidiaries as of June 30, 2025.
As of June 30, 2025, it has a PAN india presence and international network with 254 domestic offices and 3 international offices.
