About Prachay Capital Ltd.Updated on Dec 7, 2025
Incorporated in February, 2017, Prachay Capital Limited is a RBI registered non-deposit taking Non-Banking Financial Company.
The organization primarily delivers structured financial solutions to real estate developers, particularly within the mid to large business segment. Its operations are concentrated in Pune, Maharashtra, with plans for expansion into other cities such as Hyderabad and Bhubaneswar.
The company is a subsidiary of the Prachay Group, which also encompasses a boutique investment banking firm known as Prachay Advisors.
+ Read More
Objects of the Issue
The following table details the objects of the Issue (collectively, referred to herein as the“Objects”) and the amount proposed to be financed from the Net Proceeds.
For the purpose of onward lending
For the purpose of investments in current and future AIF schemes of our alternate asset management business managed by their Subsidiary Prachay Investment Managers Private Limited, which investments will be used for investments in unlisted privately placed corporate bonds.
For repayment / pre-payment, in full or in part, of certain outstanding borrowings availed by the Company
General Corporate Purposes.
NCD Review
[Dilip Davda] PCL is RBI registered NBFC engaged in investment related financial services and lending. It marked slow growth in its top and bottom lines for the reported periods. This debt offer is rated BBB -/Stable by CRISIL and offers 12.50% to 13% coupon rates for the term selected. The coupon rates are very lucrative, but the rating is poor, hence a cautious approach is needed. Well-informed investors may park moderate funds for regular interest income. (May Apply).Read detail review...
