# Edelweiss Financial Services plans to raise Rs 250 crore through NCD issue 

Issue to open on 05 December and close on 18 December 2025

 Edelweiss Financial Services has announced the public issue of 25 lakh Secured Redeemable Non-Convertible Debentures (NCDs) of the face value of Rs 1000 each for an amount aggregating up to Rs 250 crore. 

The base size issue is Rs 125 crore, with an option to retain over-subscription up to an additional Rs 125 crore (Green Shoe Option) aggregating up to Rs 250 crore. 

The issue is scheduled to open on 05 December 2025 and close on 18 December 2025, with an option of early closure or extension.
