Objects of the Issue
The Company proposes to utilise the funds which are being raised through the Issue, after deducting the Issue-related expenses to the extent payable by the Company towards funding the following objects
For onward lending, financing and repayment/prepayment of principal and interest on existing borrowings; and
General Corporate Purposes.
NCD Review
[Dilip Davda] This is the 13th debt offer from the company since September 2018. The last debt offer was in the month of July 2025. It has posted pressure on its net margins as indicated by its Q1-FY26 performance. It has maintained coupon rates with sustained rating of ACUITE BBB/Stable. Rising NPAs and falling profits raises concern. There is no harm in skipping this poorly rated debt offer that carry moderate risk.Read detail review...
