CAPITAL EXPENDITURES 
The Company invested approximately $60.9 million in capital improvements at its hotels during the nine months ended September 30, 2025. 
The Company currently expects to invest $85.0 to $90.0 million in capital improvements at its hotels in 2025, a reduction of $5.0 million from 
its prior expectation. Significant projects in 2025 include the following: 
• Hilton Garden Inn New York / Times Square Central: The Company completed a renovation of the hotel's guestrooms during the first quarter of 2025. 
