As of December 31, 2023, our outstanding debt consists of a combination of unsecured term loans and fixed-rate property-specific mortgage debt. We prefer that a significant portion of our portfolio remain unencumbered by debt in order to provide maximum balance sheet flexibility. We expect that our strategy will enable us to maintain a balance sheet with an appropriate amount of debt throughout all phases of the lodging cycle.

