 We are offering 2,307,694 shares of our common stock, par value $0.01 per share (“common stock”), at a purchase price of $6.50 per share in this offering pursuant to this prospectus supplement and the accompanying prospectus. 

 Our common stock is listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market (“Nasdaq”) under the trading symbol “CLPT.” On February 27, 2024, the last sale price of our common stock as reported on Nasdaq was $7.86 per share. 

 We are a “smaller reporting company” under applicable federal securities laws, and, as such, we are subject to reduced public company reporting requirements. Investing in shares of our common stock involves substantial risks that are described in the “ Risk Factors” sections beginning on page S-4 of this prospectus supplement, page 21 of our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2022, page 25 of our Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended March 31, 2023, page 29 of our Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended June 30, 2023, page 30 of our Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended September 30, 2023, and other reports and information that we file from time to time with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”), which are incorporated by reference into this prospectus supplement and the accompanying prospectus.
