SOLANA BEACH, Calif., Feb. 29, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ClearPoint Neuro, Inc. (Nasdaq: CLPT) (the “Company”), a global device, cell, and gene therapy-enabling company offering precise navigation to the brain and spine, announced today the pricing of its underwritten public offering of 2,307,694 shares of its common stock at a price to the public of $6.50 per share. In addition, the Company has granted the underwriter a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional 346,154 shares of its common stock at the public offering price less underwriting discounts and commissions. All the shares are being offered by the Company. The offering is expected to close on March 4, 2024, subject to customary closing conditions.
