In the third quarter of 2024, the entire ClearPoint Neuro team contributed to a record revenue quarter of $8.1 million. And in our view, the strongest financial and strategic performance in our history. We made significant progress across all 4 of our growth pillars, including: number one, Biologics and Drug Delivery; number two, Neurosurgery Navigation, number three, Therapy and Access Products; and number four, in achieving global scale.

