Botswana Assets - Selebi and Selkirk In September 2021, the Company executed the Selebi Asset Purchase Agreement ("Selebi APA") with the BCL Limited ("BCL") liquidator to acquire the Selebi Mines formerly operated by BCL. In January 2022, the Company closed the transaction and ownership of the Selebi Mines transferred to the Company.

Pursuant to the Selebi APA, the aggregate purchase price payable to the seller for the Selebi Mines shall be the sum of $77,123,330 (US$56,750,000), which amount shall be paid in three instalments:

 $2,086,830 (US$1,750,000) payable on the closing date. This payment has been made. The Company 
