As of June 30, 2025, the Company had commitments for capital expenditures over the next 12 months of $7,180 and the following other contractual obligations and commitments:

Selebi Mines

As per the Selebi APA, the aggregate purchase price payable to the seller for the Selebi Mines is the sum of US$56,750,000 which amount shall be paid in three instalments:

