robot market. The data is collected from nearly all industrial robot suppliers worldwide 
either as primary data or as secondary data through national robotics associations. The 
publication also provides estimates of the operational stock of industrial robots at year 
end. 
Chapter 1 contains definitions, classifications, methodology. 
Chapter 2 presents global data on industrial robot installations (2019–2024) and robot 
