and breakdowns by country, by application, or by industry. For the Republic of China, 
the United States, Japan, Germany and the Republic of Korea, the value of the robot 
market, and the average unit prices of robots are calculated and an estimate of the 
total world market value of industrial robot sales is deduced. 
