collected through nationally representative household sample surveys, which 
sampling was based on most recent censuses. Since 2016, Labour Force Surveys 
have been conducted and published on a quarterly basis, based on a household 
telephone survey conducted by GAStat. Employment data extracted from 
administrative records were also introduced as a complement to the results of 
Labour Force Surveys in Labour Market Statistics’ publications, starting on 
Q1 2017. 
