Array Technologies is a leading global provider of solar tracking systems and fixed-tilt mounting solutions to utility-scale and distributed generation solar projects. The company manufactures integrated single-axis trackers, dual-row trackers, fixed-tilt systems, software platforms, foundation solutions, and field services that optimize energy production across the project lifecycle. Array operates through two reportable segments: Array Legacy Operations, focused on tracker systems and software; and STI Operations, which includes the acquired Spanish subsidiary and Brazilian manufacturing. Products are sold primarily to solar developers, independent power producers, utilities, and engineering-procurement-construction firms in North America, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, Asia, and Australia.
