URL: https://taurigo.com/stocks/ARRY/articles/array-technologies-q3-2024-financial-results
For the three months ending September 30, 2024, Array Technologies reported a consolidated revenue of $231.4 million, down 34% from $350.4 million in the same period of 2023. This decline is attributed primarily to a 35% drop in revenue from its Array Legacy Operations and a 33% decrease from STI Operations. Notably, 70% of the company’s revenue still originates from the U.S., reflecting its strong market foothold.
...
of Revenue and Gross Profit

Cost of revenue saw a significant decrease, dropping by 42% to $153.0 million in Q3 2024, compared to $263.0 million in Q3 2023. This reduction is in line with lower revenue figures and reflects a decline in input costs per watt. Despite this, the gross profit margin has been hit hard by the overall revenue decline.
