May 09, 2024 Array Technologies, Inc. Reports Q1 2024 Financial Results: A Mixed Bag Amidst Solar Market Challenges Array Technologies reported a significant 59% revenue decline in Q1 2024 to $153.9 million, alongside an operating loss of $11.3 million. Despite challenges, the company improved gross profit margins and maintained solid liquidity, positioning itself to navigate the turbulent solar market.
