- Gross Profit: Gross profit fell to $57.5 million, down 44% from $100 million in Q1 2023. Despite this decline, the gross profit margin improved to 36%, up from 26% in the previous year, reflecting decreased input costs.

- Operating Loss: The company recorded an operating loss of $11.3 million, a sharp contrast to an operating income of $47.5 million in Q1 2023. 

- Net Income: The net income attributable to common stockholders was -$11.3 million, compared to a profit of $13.6 million in the prior year.

 Income Statement of Array Technologies, Inc.
