Array Technologies operates through two primary segments: Array Legacy Operations and STI Operations. 

- Array Legacy Operations: Revenue plummeted by 63% to $113.2 million, primarily due to a 60% drop in shipment volume and a 2% decrease in average selling prices (ASP).

- STI Operations: This segment experienced a revenue decrease of 45%, amounting to $39.7 million, driven by a 41% decline in volume and a 4% decrease in ASP.
