to our Calendar Put Spread Collar, suggesting that the strategy
could be an effective replacement for a “60/40” allocation,
without the explicit duration risk inherent in the bond portion
of the allocation. Our strategy shows an added benefit
historically of outperforming this mix of equities and bonds,
even in a period when rates have steadily declined.

