NVIDIA stock was extracted on a daily base from 1 Jan 2024 to 25 Dec 2024. Below are the data set columns:

- Open: This is the price at which the first trade of the day occurred. It provides a starting point for the day's trading activity.
- High: This is the highest price at which the stock traded during the trading session.
- Low: This is the lowest price at which the stock traded during the trading session.
- Close: This is the price at which the last trade occurred before the market closed for the day. It is often considered the most accurate valuation of the stock at the end of the trading day.
- Volume: This represents the total number of shares of the stock that were traded during the trading session. High volume can indicate a high level of interest in the stock, while low volume might suggest the opposite.
