Microsoft Add To Watchlist shares dipped on Wednesday as investors looked past better-than-expected earnings and revenue and focused instead on disappointing cloud results. But executives provided a dose of optimism when they predicted a cloud growth speed-up in the first half of 2025.
...
- Earnings per share: $2.95 vs. $2.93 expected
