The company faces challenges due to decreased demand from its direct supply model and exchange rate fluctuations affecting revenue translation. Additionally, the temporary suspension of production by a major customer and ongoing factory relocation have impacted operational performance. Management is focused on improving business profitability and securing additional working capital to address these challenges.

