3. May 11, 2020: Block reward fell from 12.5 BTC to 6.25 BTC, lowering the number of Bitcoins to 900 Bitcoins.
4. April 20, 2024: Block creation reward dropped from 6.25 to 3.125 BTC, dropping created coins from 900 to 450 daily (the most recent halving).

