- Separation Will Create Two Scaled Companies with Focused Business Models: Fortive to Focus on Resilient, High-Quality Recurring Growth Portfolio and the New Company Comprised of the Precision Technologies Businesses (“NewCo”) to Focus on Powerful Secular Growth Trends
- Both Companies to Offer Distinct and Compelling Investment Profiles
- Leadership Transition Expected at Spin Completion Consistent with Long-term Succession Planning
- Expects Transaction to be Completed in Q4 2025
- Remains Committed to Value-Enhancing Capital Deployment, Prioritizing Share Repurchases Through Completion of Transaction
