"We delivered solid Q1 performance despite a dynamic macro environment," the company stated in its presentation, highlighting adjusted operating margin expansion of 20 basis points despite lower revenue. Adjusted earnings per share grew 2% to $0.85, while adjusted free cash flow reached $222 million.

