Section 230(b) of the Act provides the formula used to determine the OASDI contribution and benefit base. Under the formula, the base for 2024 is the larger of: (1) the 1994 base of $60,600 multiplied by the ratio of the national average wage index for 2022 to that for 1992; or (2) the current base ($160,200). If the resulting amount is not a multiple of $300, we round it to the nearest multiple of $300.
